# Spark IDE keymap — proven keys, save (`s`) focus.
# After save-reopen (11ab006) + status strip (b029a4a).
# Dry: script `s` → {"cmd":"save"} trace (no write); open still reads.
# Also proves single `ide key save` after open.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_keys_save.spark
# No Electron. No new asm — documents proven keys only.

ide keys "examples/fixtures/ide/cmds_save.txt"

ide key open "examples/hello.spark"

ide key save
